  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 6216912896
    m_Localized: Minimum possible size for each room in the generated dungeon.\n\nIf
      you set it higher, rooms will always be at least this big, making the dungeon
      feel more spacious but possibly with fewer rooms.\n\nIf you set it lower, smaller
      rooms can appear, which may make the dungeon feel more cramped but allows for
      more rooms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 42547974144
    m_Localized: Maximum possible size for each room in the dungeon.\n\nIf you set
      it higher, rooms can become very large, possibly dominating the dungeon layout.\n\nIf
      you set it lower, all rooms will be smaller, making the dungeon feel more segmented.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 72314949632
    m_Localized: How many times the dungeon space is split to create rooms and corridors.\n\nIf
      you set it higher, the dungeon will have more rooms and corridors, making it
      more complex.\n\nIf you set it lower, the dungeon will have fewer, larger rooms
      and a simpler layout.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 92061732864
    m_Localized: 'Controls how stretched or square the rooms and splits can be. It
      affects whether the dungeon splits more horizontally or vertically.\n\nIf you
      set it higher, rooms and splits will tend to be more elongated in one direction,
      creating long corridors or rooms.\n\nIf you set it lower, rooms and splits
      will be more balanced, resulting in more square-shaped rooms. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 113020669952
    m_Localized: The width of the corridors connecting rooms in the dungeon. Wider
      corridors make movement easier and the dungeon feel more open.\n\nIf you set
      it higher, corridors will be wider, making navigation easier but using more
      space.\n\nIf you set it lower, corridors will be narrower, making the dungeon
      feel tighter and possibly more challenging to navigate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15070516533432320
    m_Localized: Partitioned Room
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15381682325458944
    m_Localized: Minimum room size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15387579986644992
    m_Localized: Maximum room size
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15388984554196992
    m_Localized: Maximum iterations
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15389128796311552
    m_Localized: Corridor width
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 15389128255246336
    m_Localized: Aspect proportion
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
